1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,520
Looking beyond the weighing scale
When adults with overweight reduce calories, overall scale weight drops, but a 2025 review of 25 trials evaluated what happens beneath the surface.

2
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:22,020
Protecting fat-free mass
Adding resistance exercise helped adults preserve fat-free mass (moderate certainty)—which is not the same as muscle—and shed more fat mass (high certainty).

3
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:32,180
Strength and study limitations
Muscular strength improved (low certainty). Subgroup lean mass preservation did not reach statistical significance in trials longer than five months.

4
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:42,680
Nourishing strength every day
Instead of focusing solely on the bathroom scale, how might you build strength and support your body through your everyday routine?
